#: ../content/index.rst:32
msgid "If running in docker, it is necessary for a file which the package includes to be in place. Please put the file ``scripts/docker-compose/seccomp_profile.json`` in the directory where the docker-compose file of the OTOBO installation is located, e.g. to ``/opt/otobo-docker/docker-compose/seccomp_profile.json``."
